+// No new intrinsic needed -- store the bits, load them back at Float type.
+// `__raw_get<Float>` already lowers to RawGet + GpToFp (a movq into an xmm), which is
+// precisely the reinterpret; see passes/4_MIR_to_LIR.fs. toBits had no inverse at all,
+// so a Float could not be RECONSTRUCTED in compiled code, which blocked decoding any
+// type containing one (Json's `Number of Float` -> altJsonParse).
